  "description": "The sender's inception has four signing keys with the weighted signing threshold [1/2, 1/2, 1/4, 1/4], which is met when the weights of the signing keys sum to at least one (KERI line 1419). The exn outside any transaction carries valid signatures by the keys at indices 2 and 3, whose weights sum to 1/2. The weighted threshold is not satisfied (KERI line 1260), so it is rejected at MUST. An implementation that counts signatures without weighing them fails this case. KERI-0081 is its positive pair.",
